layName":"Referee","id":"24"},"order":0},{"fullName":"Jesse Marquis","displayName":"Jesse Marquis","position":{"name":"Linesman","displayName":"Linesman","id":"25"},"order":0}]},"article":{"headline":"Kyle Connor scores twice, Jets beat Avalanche 3-2 for 3rd straight victory","description":"— Kyle Connor broke a tie with a minute left with his second goal of game, Stuart Skinner made 32 saves and the Winnipeg Jets beat the Colorado Avalanche 3-2 on Wednesday night for their third straight victory.","story":"WINNIPEG, Manitoba -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3899952/kyle-connor\">Kyle Connor</a> broke a tie with a minute left with his second goal of game, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4268767/stuart-skinner\">Stuart Skinner</a> made 32 saves and the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/wpg/winnipeg-jets\">Winnipeg Jets</a> beat the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/col/colorado-avalanche\">Colorado Avalanche</a> 3-2 on Wednesday night for their third straight victory.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/2562632/mark-scheifele\">Mark Scheifele</a> sent a pass from near the boards across to Connor charging the net and he fired a shot that beat goalie <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3904177/mackenzie-blackwood\">Mackenzie Blackwood</a>. Connor has five goals in four games.\n\n\r\n              Connor and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4697392/cole-perfetti\">Cole Perfetti</a> had second-period goal to give the Jets a 2-1 lead.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4874736/fedor-svechkov\">Fedor Svechkov</a> tied it for Colorado with 7:25 left in the third.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5835/jaden-schwartz\">Jaden Schwartz</a> opened the scoring in the first for the Avalanche. Blackwood stopped 16 shots.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Avalanche: At Calgary on Thursday night.\n\n\r\n              Jets: Host Anaheim on Friday night.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              \r\n                <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/nhl\">See AP’s full NHL coverage here</a>","published":"2026-10-08T02:46:27Z"}}